    <item>
      <title>我让 AI 自己打通 Cheat Engine 训练关：它错了六次，第七次换了问法</title>
      <link>https://ip2867.github.io/post/cheat-engine-ai-agent/</link>
      <pubDate>Mon, 26 Oct 2026 00:28:00 &#43;0800</pubDate>
